// # emit-x86 minus-first mixed concat
//
// Logline: Print unary-minus 7 plus x so emit-x86 can lower a const negative INT plus STRING.
//
// Setup: Product path is oodac emit-x86 on this file, then as and ld. No greet. No hello fold.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Declare main.
//   2. Concat unary-minus 7 and x.
//   3. Print the result.
//
// residual: int plus int and greet calls stay later.

pub fn main() {
    println(-7 + "x");
}
